## The params Keyword

For a variable number of arguments, use `params`:
```csharp
void LogAll(params string[] messages)
{
    foreach (string msg in messages) Debug.Log(msg);
}
// Call: LogAll("a", "b", "c");
```
It's a form of overloading without creating many signatures.
